<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Brand Strength - We Measure the Levers for Sustainable Demand</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    width: 1024px;
    height: 576px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .header {
    padding: 20px 40px 10px 40px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
  }
  .main-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 27px;
    color: #c0392b;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .body-area {
    position: relative;
    padding: 15px 40px 10px 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  /* People icons column */
  .people-col {
    width: 130px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 400px;
    padding-top: 60px;
  }
  .person-block {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .person-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    color: #a94442;
    margin: 0 auto 8px auto;
  }
  .person-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .person-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #cccccc;
  }

  /* Internal factors label */
  .factors-label {
    width: 90px;
    padding-top: 175px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #cccccc;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .factors-label.external {
    padding-top: 175px;
  }

  /* Item list columns */
  .items-col {
    width: 350px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid #888888;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }

  .item .placeholder {
    width: 60px;
    height: 45px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: #333333;
    color: #999999;
    font-size: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .item-text h3 {
    margin: 0 0 3px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .item-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #cccccc;
  }

  .logo {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 8px;
    right: 40px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header">
    <p class="eyebrow">BRAND STRENGTH</p>
    <h1 class="main-title">WE MEASURE THE LEVERS FOR SUSTAINABLE DEMAND</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="body-area">

    <!-- People icons -->
    <div class="people-col">
      <div class="person-block">
        <svg class="person-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="12" cy="6" r="3"/><path d="M12 11c-4 0-7 2-7 5v3h14v-3c0-3-3-5-7-5z"/></svg>
        <div class="person-label">Employees</div>
        <div class="person-sub">(Current &amp; Prospective)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="person-block">
        <svg class="person-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="12" cy="6" r="3"/><path d="M12 11c-4 0-7 2-7 5v3h14v-3c0-3-3-5-7-5z"/></svg>
        <div class="person-label">Customers</div>
        <div class="person-sub">(Current &amp; Prospective)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Internal factors label -->
    <div class="factors-label">INTERNAL<br>FACTORS</div>

    <!-- Internal items -->
    <div class="items-col">
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: hand pointing]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Clarity</h3>
          <p>Clarity internally about what the brand stands for and its values, positioning and proposition. Clarity too about target audiences, customer insights and drivers. Because so much hinges on this, it is vital that these are articulated and shared across the organization.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: hands with red object]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Commitment</h3>
          <p>Internal commitment to brand, and a belief internally in the importance of brand. The extent to which the brand receives support in terms of time, influence, and investment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: hands cupped]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Protection</h3>
          <p>How secure the brand is across a number of dimensions: legal protection, proprietary ingredients or design, scale or geographical spread.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: sky/clouds]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Responsiveness</h3>
          <p>The ability to respond to market changes, challenges and opportunities. The brand should have a sense of leadership internally and a desire and ability to constantly evolve and renew itself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- External factors label -->
    <div class="factors-label external">EXTERNAL<br>FACTORS</div>

    <!-- External items -->
    <div class="items-col">
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: apple]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Authenticity</h3>
          <p>The brand is soundly based on an internal truth and capability. It has a defined heritage and a well grounded value set. It can deliver against the (high) expectations that customers have of it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: person portrait]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Relevance</h3>
          <p>The fit with customer/consumer needs, desires, and decision criteria across all relevant demographics and geographies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: colored tags]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Differentiation</h3>
          <p>The degree to which customers/ consumers perceive the brand to have a differentiated positioning distinctive from the competition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: colored tags]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Consistency</h3>
          <p>The degree to which a brand is experienced without fail across all touchpoints or formats.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: storefront sign]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Presence</h3>
          <p>The degree to which a brand feels omnipresent and is talked about positively by consumers, customers and opinion formers in both traditional and social media.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: child with book]</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <h3>Understanding</h3>
          <p>The brand is not only recognised by customers, but there is also an in-depth knowledge and under-standing of its distinctive qualities and characteristics (Where relevant, this includes consumer understanding of the company that owns the brand).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="logo">Interbrand</div>

</body>
</html>
